      "description": "A heavy cut-crystal balloon glass engraved 'E.A.', the one glass in the house nobody else was allowed to use. A finger of brandy remains, with a greenish-brown film on the bottom and a sharp, bitter, herbal smell under the spirit. The other brandy glasses of the set are clean and dry; the only other glasses used tonight are two plain whisky tumblers. The poison was in his glass and only his, so it was put there by someone who knew his habits.",
      "found_in": "study",
