      "description": "A typed draft from Vance's briefcase headed 'Codicil to the Will of Edmund Ashgrove', dated today. It removes 'Leonard Vance, Esquire' as sole trustee of the Ashgrove Family Trust, appoints 'my daughter Clara Ashgrove' in his place from 1 January 1949, and calls for a full accounting of the trust. Edmund's pencil corrections and initials are on every page; it is unsigned and unwitnessed. Tonight Edmund was taking the family money out of Vance's hands.",
      "found_in": "hallway",
