          "text": "Recognizes the handkerchief at once: she gave Simon a dozen embroidered S.W. handkerchiefs last Christmas. He had one in his breast pocket at dinner tonight, and the pocket was empty when he came back to the drawing room at about 21:20.",
          "condition": "shown_evidence:digitalis-bottle"
        },
        {
          "clue_id": "clara-line-dead",
          "text": "Says that when she ran to the hall telephone at about 22:00 to call Dr. Peel the line was dead, and Simon said at once that it must only just have gone down, because he had been talking to the city less than an hour before.",
          "condition": "free"
