      "id": "vance",
      "name": "Leonard Vance",
      "role": "Family attorney (Vance and Pryor) and trustee of the Ashgrove Family Trust",
      "age": 54,
      "portrait": "man-glasses",
      "color": "#6b7f99",
      "personality": "Smooth, precise and endlessly polite. He treats every question as a deposition and every answer as a contract, never raises his voice and never quite answers. He was fond of Edmund in his dry way and is genuinely shaken, but he is more frightened of an audit than of any detective. Vain about his memory, his cufflinks and his vocabulary.",
