      "personality": "A torch singer with a voice like smoke and a temper she keeps on a short leash. Proud, weary and fiercely protective of her kid brother, whom she has been bailing out since their mother died. She ended things with Kale last autumn and has hated herself a little for every song she has sung for him since. She lies badly for herself and well for Danny.",
      "speech_style": "Low, slow and husky, with long pauses she uses like rests in a song. Calls the detective 'honey' when she is annoyed and 'Detective' when she is scared. Talks in short, smoky images: rain on the skylight, cheap rye and cheaper promises. Turns cold and clipped whenever Danny is mentioned.",
